~ ada_launch_game
$> MainCommunicator.send_signal_to_main(MainCommunicator.SignalType.ADD_MINIGAME, [load("res://src/minigames/connect4/connect_4.tscn"), {"computer_playstyle":0, "computer_name":"ada"}])
=> END

